msgid ""
"This is the `Frei0r curves <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterFrei0r-"
"curves/>`_ MLT filter."
msgstr ""
"Este é o filtro de `curvas de Frei0r <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/Fil"
"terFrei0r-curves/>`_ de MLT."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves.rst:19
msgid "Adjusts luminance or color channel intensity with curve level mapping."
msgstr ""
"Axusta a intensidade das canles de luminancia e de cor con asociacións de"
" niveis de curvas."

#. +> trunk5
#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves.rst:21
msgid ""
"The :ref:`bezier_curves` filter is also an interface to this same Frei0r"
" filter."
msgstr ""
"O filtro :ref:`bezier_curves` é outra interface para o mesmo filtro de Frei0r."

